      "statement": "Automatic first-review and push dispatch paths create an 'Open SWE Review' GitHub check run and store review_check_run_id in thread metadata; settle_review_check_run completes it on publish, only clearing the id after a successful PATCH and stashing the intended result in review_check_pending_result so a transient failure is retried with the real conclusion.",
